  "review_notes": [
    "Pocket exterior now continues the adjacent limestone courses with a narrow service seam; inside skin matches warm plaster.",
    "Six native images rendered and visually reviewed: rear open/closed, west garden, vault, kitchen-to-vault and new dedicated fireplace view. The paired terrace cameras and actual opening travel are preserved.",
    "Eight earlier views retain their reviewed images because the revised west pocket and fireplace are outside their visible content: great room, serving counter open/closed, front arrival, roof/parking, entry hall, primary bath and living retreat.",
    "Fresh native and isolated-checkout reopening confirm 38 pinned library versions and portable links. 2720 gross enclosed square feet, rooms and existing routes are preserved.",
    "The new linked electric fireplace has a real surround recess, 3-foot clear front removal reservation, 3.05 feet to the chaise and separation from the sliding pocket. Twenty interior routes, 420 panel/wall checks and 16800 additional panel/fireplace comparisons pass.",
    "IFC4 schema validation passed with zero errors. Actual Bonsai import reopened 807 mesh products and compared 135 product geometries, including the new facade courses, linked fireplace and five surround parts.",
    "All ten updated booklet pages were visually inspected. The floor plan shows the fireplace and the living-room page shows its dedicated native view. Site and roof-section geometry is unchanged.",
    "The exterior and two interior Image Gen studies were refreshed from reviewed current sources; actual prompts and source/image hashes are stored with each study.",
    "The Coastal gallery and its root catalog card pass coverage and source-hash checks. Other homes under concurrent development are outside this review."
  ],
